welcome to Sky forge a new MMORPG where  your goal is to transform yourself from  an immortal hero into a mighty God there  are a huge number of paths you can take  to reach your goal the tool which shows  you these character progression paths  and helps you choose your way is called  the ascension atlas it displays all the  directions in which you may develop your  character as you travel along your  chosen path new nodes unlock before you  each new node means new abilities and  better stats the more nodes you unlock  the more powerful you become your combos  will be more sophisticated your attacks  deadlier and you will learn new  spectacular skills the ascension Atlas  is not the only distinctive part of  character progression in skyforge we  also left the common notion of class  selection behind are you tired of the  paladin's combat style always having to  tank in the middle of a big crowd switch  to a gunner class and kill your foes at  range in Skyforge you are free to switch  your character to any of the ten classes  available at launch there is no need to  real evelope with each new class you  unlock because your character's power  and progress is maintained across all of  your classes the option of easily  switching between classes and combat  roles is particularly convenient when  playing in a group if your party likes a  tank or a decent support character no  problem just change your class and  you're good to go  this means groups can devise their own  composition for any boss fight Skye  forges innovative class selection and  development makes the Ascension Atlas a  powerful and flexible tool for  developing your character  millions of ways to combine your skills  and styles making each character truly  unique you can always find the latest  skyforge chronicles releases news and  project updates and sign up for beta on  skyforge dot-com and by following us on  your favorite social network
 

